@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> RegisterLogin : register or log in with details

state RegisterLogin <<choice>> as initial_state
state LoginDetails
state ContinueAs <<choice>>
state TeacherChoice <<choice>>
state StudentChoice <<choice>>
state CreateQuiz
state EditQuiz
state SaveDraftOrPost
state ViewResults
state SelectQuiz
state AnswerQuiz
state SubmitQuiz
state ViewResult

initial_state --> RegisterLogin : register or log in with details
RegisterLogin --> LoginDetails : register or log in with details
LoginDetails --> ContinueAs : continue as a teacher or student
ContinueAs --> TeacherChoice : continue as a teacher [valid]
ContinueAs --> StudentChoice : continue as a student [invalid]
TeacherChoice --> CreateQuiz : create a new quiz [valid]
TeacherChoice --> EditQuiz : edit an existing quiz [invalid]
CreateQuiz --> SaveDraftOrPost : save as draft or post for students
SaveDraftOrPost --> ViewResults : view quiz results once over [valid]
StudentChoice --> SelectQuiz : select a quiz after notification [valid]
SelectQuiz --> AnswerQuiz : answer the selected quiz [valid]
AnswerQuiz --> SubmitQuiz : submit their quiz [valid]
SubmitQuiz --> ViewResult : view result after submitting [valid]

ViewResults --> [*] : completion event
ViewResult --> [*] : completion event

@enduml
